# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Firebase Ranking 1.0 Phase 1B (Issue #87): functions/lib is esbuild's bundled deploy output
# (rebuilt by `npm run build` inside functions/, see functions/package.json), never source.
# .firebaserc holds a real Firebase project id once Manual Setup creates one (see
# .firebaserc.example) -- like .env.local, it's local/per-environment, never committed.
functions/lib
.firebaserc
.firebase/

# Review Playthrough videos (Human Review evidence) -- delivered to the user directly, never
# committed (large binaries don't belong in this repo's history).
artifacts/

# Playwright e2e test output (playwright.config.ts, e2e/) -- ephemeral run artifacts, never
# committed (mirrors artifacts/ above).
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
